sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Operator as Operateur
  participant FE as Frontend Next.js
  participant GW as API Gateway GraphQL
  participant Guard as GqlJwtAuthGuard
  participant Incident as Incident Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Notif as Notification Service
  participant WS as WebSocket /notifications

  FE->>WS: Connexion Socket.IO notifications
  WS-->>FE: Connexion acceptee

  Operator->>FE: Declare un incident
  FE->>GW: mutation createIncident(input)\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT
  GW->>Incident: Forward mutation + Authorization
  Incident->>Guard: Validation JWT
  alt Token absent ou invalide
    Guard-->>Incident: Unauthorized
    Incident-->>GW: Erreur GraphQL
    GW-->>FE: Erreur GraphQL
    FE-->>Operator: Affiche acces refuse
  else Token valide OPERATOR/ADMIN
    Incident->>DB: Cree Incident status SIGNALE
    Incident->>Notif: mutation createNotificationFromEvent\nIncident alert
    Notif->>DB: Cree Notification
    Notif->>WS: Emet notification temps reel
    WS-->>FE: Notification recue
    Incident-->>GW: Incident cree
    GW-->>FE: Incident cree
    FE->>FE: Ajoute incident sur la carte
    FE-->>Operator: Confirmation
  end

  Operator->>FE: Change le statut de l'incident
  FE->>GW: mutation updateIncidentStatus(id, status)
  GW->>Incident: Forward mutation + Authorization
  Incident->>DB: Met a jour le statut
  Incident-->>GW: Incident mis a jour
  GW-->>FE: Incident mis a jour
